BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:evia-north-limni-klidonas-of-ai-giannis-limni-harbour-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270623
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270625
SUMMARY:Klidonas of Ai-Giannis\, Limni harbour
LOCATION:Limni\, Evia (North)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On 23 June the Elymnians light the St John's bonfire on the harbour of Limni and revive the klidonas: girls' tokens drawn from a jug of 'silent water'\, couplets\, jumping the flames\, then music on the quay. It is in the municipal summer programme every year and free\; the seafront tavernas are the place to sit and watch.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#limni-klidonas-of-ai-giannis-limni-harbour
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#limni-klidonas-of-ai-giannis-limni-harbour
END:VEVENT
