BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:evia-north-papades-panigiri-of-panagia-eve-of-15-august-papades-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia (eve of 15 August)\, Papades
LOCATION:Papades\, Evia (North)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The village of Papades\, in the hills between Agia Anna and Vasilika\, throws its Panagia panigiri in the square on the night of 14 August with a live orchestra\, organised by the local cultural society and listed by the municipality. Small\, cheap and genuinely local\; the coast villages are 15 minutes away for a bed.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#papades-panigiri-of-panagia-eve-of-15-august-papades
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#papades-panigiri-of-panagia-eve-of-15-august-papades
END:VEVENT
